   \[
   \sum_{j \in J} w_j x_{ij} \leq C_i, \quad \forall i \in I
   \]

2. **Nonnegativity and integrality:**
   \[
   x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}, \quad \forall i \in I,\, j \in J
   \]

